{"id": "m01", "genre": "moral", "split": "dev", "familiar": true, "title": "The fox and the grapes", "cast": {"fox": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a hungry fox"}, "vineyard": {"kind": "place", "name": "a vineyard"}, "grapes": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a bunch of ripe grapes", "words": ["grapes", "bunch"]}, "branch": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a high branch"}, "ground": {"kind": "place", "name": "the ground"}}, "lines": [{"text": "One hot afternoon, a hungry fox walked into a vineyard.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "fox", "to": "vineyard"}], "rel": [["fox", "in", "vineyard"]]}, {"text": "He saw a bunch of ripe grapes hanging from a high branch.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "fox", "to": "grapes"}], "rel": [["grapes", "on", "branch"]]}, {"text": "The fox jumped as high as he could.", "ev": [{"act": "jump", "by": "fox"}]}, {"text": "He missed and fell back onto the ground.", "ev": [{"act": "fall", "by": "fox", "to": "ground"}]}, {"text": "He stepped back and jumped again.", "ev": [{"act": "jump", "by": "fox"}]}, {"text": "Again he could not reach the grapes.", "ev": [{"act": "reach", "by": "fox", "to": "grapes"}]}, {"text": "At last the tired fox sat down under the branch.", "ev": [{"act": "sit", "by": "fox"}], "rel": [["fox", "under", "branch"]]}, {"text": "He looked up and said, those grapes are sour anyway.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "fox", "to": "grapes"}, {"act": "say", "by": "fox"}]}, {"text": "Then he walked away with his nose in the air.", "ev": [{"act": "leave", "by": "fox"}]}]},
{"id": "m02", "genre": "moral", "split": "dev", "familiar": false, "title": "The potter's cracked pot", "cast": {"potter": {"kind": "person", "name": "An old potter", "gender": "he"}, "village": {"kind": "place", "name": "a small village"}, "well": {"kind": "place", "name": "a well"}, "pots": {"kind": "prop", "name": "two pots", "words": ["pots", "pot"], "split_ok": true}, "home": {"kind": "place", "name": "home"}, "flowers": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the flowers"}}, "lines": [{"text": "An old potter lived in a small village near a well.", "ev": [], "rel": [["potter", "in", "village"], ["well", "next_to", "village"]]}, {"text": "Every morning he carried two pots to the well.", "ev": [{"act": "carry", "by": "potter", "obj": "pots"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "potter", "to": "well"}], "rel": [["potter", "hold", "pots"]]}, {"text": "One pot had a long crack in its side.", "ev": [{"act": "be_cracked", "by": "pots", "never": true}]}, {"text": "He filled both pots with water and walked home.", "ev": [{"act": "fill", "by": "potter", "obj": "pots"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "potter", "to": "home"}]}, {"text": "Water dripped from the cracked pot all along the path.", "ev": [{"act": "drip", "by": "pots"}]}, {"text": "The cracked pot said to the potter, I am sorry, I am broken.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "pots", "to": "potter"}]}, {"text": "The potter smiled and pointed at the flowers along the path.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "potter", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "point", "by": "potter", "to": "flowers"}]}, {"text": "Those flowers grew because of your water, he said.", "ev": [{"act": "grow", "by": "flowers"}, {"act": "say", "by": "potter", "to": "pots"}]}, {"text": "The pot felt happy and the potter walked on to the village.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "pots", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "potter", "to": "village"}]}]},
{"id": "m03", "genre": "moral", "split": "dev", "familiar": true, "title": "The lion and the mouse", "cast": {"lion": {"kind": "animal", "name": "A big lion"}, "tree": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a shady tree"}, "mouse": {"kind": "animal", "name": "A little mouse"}, "hunters": {"kind": "group", "name": "hunters"}, "rope": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a strong rope", "words": ["rope"]}}, "lines": [{"text": "A big lion was sleeping under a shady tree.", "ev": [{"act": "sleep", "by": "lion"}], "rel": [["lion", "under", "tree"]]}, {"text": "A little mouse ran across his back.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "mouse", "to": "lion"}], "rel": [["mouse", "on", "lion"]]}, {"text": "The lion woke up and caught the mouse with his paw.", "ev": [{"act": "wake", "by": "lion"}, {"act": "catch", "by": "lion", "obj": "mouse"}]}, {"text": "The mouse cried, please let me go and one day I will help you.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "mouse", "to": "lion"}]}, {"text": "The lion laughed and let the mouse go.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "lion", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "let_go", "by": "lion", "to": "mouse"}]}, {"text": "A few days later, hunters tied the lion to the tree with a strong rope.", "ev": [{"act": "tie", "by": "hunters", "obj": "lion", "to": "tree"}], "rel": [["lion", "next_to", "tree"]]}, {"text": "The lion roared for help.", "ev": [{"act": "shout", "by": "lion"}]}, {"text": "The mouse heard him and ran to the tree.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "mouse", "to": "tree"}]}, {"text": "She chewed through the rope with her sharp teeth.", "ev": [{"act": "cut", "by": "mouse", "obj": "rope"}]}, {"text": "The lion was free, and he thanked the little mouse.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "lion", "to": "mouse"}]}]},
{"id": "m04", "genre": "moral", "split": "val", "familiar": false, "title": "The shepherd girl and the lost goat", "cast": {"meera": {"kind": "person", "name": "A shepherd girl named Meera", "gender": "she", "words": ["meera", "girl", "shepherd"]}, "goats": {"kind": "group", "name": "goats", "words": ["goats"]}, "hill": {"kind": "place", "name": "a hill"}, "stick": {"kind": "prop", "name": "her stick"}, "river": {"kind": "place", "name": "the river"}, "rock": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a big rock"}, "kid": {"kind": "animal", "name": "The little goat", "words": ["goat"]}, "grass": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the grass"}}, "lines": [{"text": "A shepherd girl named Meera kept goats on a hill.", "ev": [], "rel": [["meera", "on", "hill"], ["goats", "on", "hill"]]}, {"text": "One evening she counted them and one small goat was missing.", "ev": [{"act": "count", "by": "meera", "obj": "goats"}]}, {"text": "Meera picked up her stick and walked down to the river.", "ev": [{"act": "pick_up", "by": "meera", "obj": "stick"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "meera", "to": "river"}]}, {"text": "She heard a faint cry from behind a big rock.", "ev": [{"act": "hear", "by": "meera", "never": true}]}, {"text": "The little goat was stuck behind the rock.", "ev": [], "rel": [["kid", "behind", "rock"]]}, {"text": "Meera knelt down and pulled the goat out gently.", "ev": [{"act": "kneel", "by": "meera"}, {"act": "pull", "by": "meera", "obj": "kid"}]}, {"text": "She carried the goat in her arms back up the hill.", "ev": [{"act": "carry", "by": "meera", "obj": "kid"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "meera", "to": "hill"}], "rel": [["meera", "hold", "kid"]]}, {"text": "The other goats ran to her happily.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "goats", "to": "meera"}]}, {"text": "Meera put the little goat down and sat on the grass.", "ev": [{"act": "put_down", "by": "meera", "obj": "kid"}, {"act": "sit_on", "by": "meera", "to": "grass"}], "rel": [["meera", "sit_on", "grass"]]}, {"text": "She smiled and said, nobody gets left behind.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "meera", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "say", "by": "meera"}]}]},
{"id": "m05", "genre": "moral", "split": "test", "familiar": true, "title": "The thirsty crow", "cast": {"crow": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a thirsty crow"}, "fields": {"kind": "place", "name": "the fields"}, "pot": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a pot of water", "words": ["pot"]}, "tree": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a tree"}, "water": {"kind": "agent", "name": "The water", "words": ["water"]}, "pebbles": {"kind": "prop", "name": "some small pebbles", "words": ["pebbles", "pebble"], "split_ok": true}, "ground": {"kind": "place", "name": "the ground"}}, "lines": [{"text": "On a very hot day, a thirsty crow flew over the fields.", "ev": [{"act": "fly", "by": "crow", "to": "fields"}], "rel": [["crow", "above", "fields"]]}, {"text": "He saw a pot of water under a tree.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "crow", "to": "pot"}], "rel": [["pot", "under", "tree"]]}, {"text": "The crow flew down and sat on the edge of the pot.", "ev": [{"act": "fly", "by": "crow", "to": "pot"}, {"act": "sit_on", "by": "crow", "to": "pot"}], "rel": [["crow", "sit_on", "pot"]]}, {"text": "The water was too low for his beak to reach.", "ev": [{"act": "be_low", "by": "water", "never": true}]}, {"text": "He looked around and saw some small pebbles on the ground.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "crow", "to": "pebbles"}], "rel": [["pebbles", "on", "ground"]]}, {"text": "The crow picked up a pebble in his beak.", "ev": [{"act": "pick_up", "by": "crow", "obj": "pebbles"}], "rel": [["crow", "hold", "pebbles"]]}, {"text": "He dropped the pebble into the pot.", "ev": [{"act": "drop", "by": "crow", "obj": "pebbles", "to": "pot"}], "rel": [["pebbles", "in", "pot"]]}, {"text": "One by one, he dropped many pebbles into the pot.", "ev": [{"act": "drop", "by": "crow", "obj": "pebbles", "to": "pot"}]}, {"text": "Slowly the water rose up to the top.", "ev": [{"act": "rise", "by": "water"}]}, {"text": "The crow drank the water happily and flew away.", "ev": [{"act": "drink", "by": "crow", "obj": "water"}, {"act": "leave", "by": "crow"}]}]},
{"id": "m06", "genre": "moral", "split": "test", "familiar": false, "title": "The boy who shared his umbrella", "cast": {"rain": {"kind": "agent", "name": "raining", "words": ["raining", "rain"]}, "kabir": {"kind": "person", "name": "A boy named Kabir", "gender": "he", "words": ["kabir", "boy"]}, "umbrella": {"kind": "prop", "name": "his big blue umbrella", "words": ["umbrella"]}, "gate": {"kind": "place", "name": "the gate"}, "oldman": {"kind": "person", "name": "an old man", "gender": "he", "words": ["man"]}, "stop": {"kind": "place", "name": "the bus stop", "words": ["stop"]}, "bus": {"kind": "prop", "name": "The bus", "words": ["bus"]}, "home": {"kind": "place", "name": "home"}}, "lines": [{"text": "It was raining hard when school ended.", "ev": [{"act": "rain", "by": "rain"}]}, {"text": "A boy named Kabir opened his big blue umbrella.", "ev": [{"act": "open", "by": "kabir", "obj": "umbrella"}], "rel": [["kabir", "hold", "umbrella"]]}, {"text": "At the gate he saw an old man standing in the rain without one.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "kabir", "to": "oldman"}], "rel": [["oldman", "next_to", "gate"]]}, {"text": "Kabir walked over to him and held the umbrella over his head.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "kabir", "to": "oldman"}], "rel": [["umbrella", "above", "oldman"]]}, {"text": "The old man said, thank you, young man.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "oldman", "to": "kabir"}]}, {"text": "They walked together to the bus stop.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "kabir", "to": "stop"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "oldman", "to": "stop"}]}, {"text": "The bus came and the old man climbed in.", "ev": [{"act": "arrive", "by": "bus", "to": "stop"}, {"act": "get_in", "by": "oldman", "to": "bus"}], "rel": [["oldman", "in", "bus"]]}, {"text": "He waved goodbye to Kabir from the window.", "ev": [{"act": "wave", "by": "oldman", "to": "kabir"}]}, {"text": "Kabir smiled and ran home in the rain.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "kabir", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "run", "by": "kabir", "to": "home"}]}]},
{"id": "m07", "genre": "moral", "split": "test", "familiar": true, "title": "The hare and the tortoise", "cast": {"hare": {"kind": "animal", "name": "A proud hare"}, "tortoise": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a slow tortoise"}, "tree": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the big oak tree", "words": ["tree", "oak"]}, "bush": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a bush"}}, "lines": [{"text": "A proud hare laughed at a slow tortoise.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "hare", "val": "happy"}]}, {"text": "The tortoise said, let us have a race to the big oak tree.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "tortoise", "to": "hare"}]}, {"text": "The race began and the hare ran very fast.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "hare"}]}, {"text": "Soon he was far ahead, so he lay down under a bush.", "ev": [{"act": "lie", "by": "hare"}], "rel": [["hare", "under", "bush"]]}, {"text": "The hare fell asleep in the warm sun.", "ev": [{"act": "sleep", "by": "hare"}]}, {"text": "The tortoise walked slowly past the sleeping hare.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "tortoise"}]}, {"text": "When the hare woke up, the tortoise was near the oak tree.", "ev": [{"act": "wake", "by": "hare"}], "rel": [["tortoise", "next_to", "tree"]]}, {"text": "The hare ran as fast as he could.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "hare"}]}, {"text": "But the tortoise reached the tree first.", "ev": [{"act": "arrive", "by": "tortoise", "to": "tree"}]}, {"text": "The tortoise smiled and said, slow and steady wins the race.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "tortoise", "val": "happy"}, {"act": "say", "by": "tortoise"}]}]},
{"id": "m08", "genre": "moral", "split": "test", "familiar": false, "title": "The miller and the honest coin", "cast": {"miller": {"kind": "person", "name": "A poor miller"}, "wheat": {"kind": "prop", "name": "wheat", "words": ["wheat"]}, "mill": {"kind": "place", "name": "his mill"}, "stream": {"kind": "place", "name": "the stream"}, "merchant": {"kind": "person", "name": "A rich merchant"}, "horse": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a grey horse"}, "sack": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a sack of wheat", "words": ["sack"]}, "coin": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a gold coin"}}, "lines": [{"text": "A poor miller was grinding wheat at his mill by the stream.", "ev": [{"act": "work", "by": "miller", "to": "wheat"}], "rel": [["miller", "in", "mill"], ["mill", "next_to", "stream"]]}, {"text": "A rich merchant rode up on a grey horse.", "ev": [{"act": "ride", "by": "merchant", "to": "horse"}, {"act": "arrive", "by": "merchant"}], "rel": [["merchant", "ride", "horse"]]}, {"text": "He got off his horse and gave the miller a sack of wheat to grind.", "ev": [{"act": "get_off", "by": "merchant", "to": "horse"}, {"act": "give", "by": "merchant", "obj": "sack", "to": "miller"}], "end": [["merchant", "ride", "horse"]]}, {"text": "Inside the sack the miller found a gold coin.", "ev": [{"act": "find", "by": "miller", "obj": "coin"}], "rel": [["coin", "in", "sack"]]}, {"text": "He held the coin and thought for a moment.", "ev": [{"act": "hold", "by": "miller", "obj": "coin"}, {"act": "react", "by": "miller", "val": "think"}], "rel": [["miller", "hold", "coin"]]}, {"text": "Then he ran after the merchant and called out, sir, you dropped this.", "ev": [{"act": "chase", "by": "miller", "to": "merchant"}, {"act": "say", "by": "miller", "to": "merchant"}]}, {"text": "The merchant turned around and looked at the coin.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "merchant", "to": "coin"}]}, {"text": "He said, you are an honest man, keep it as a reward.", "ev": [{"act": "say", "by": "merchant", "to": "miller"}]}, {"text": "The miller bowed and walked back to his mill with a smile.", "ev": [{"act": "bow", "by": "miller"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "miller", "to": "mill"}, {"act": "react", "by": "miller", "val": "happy"}]}]}
